  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Undead you create are even stronger than usual.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Death sphere (Empowered Reanimate).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> All creatures you reanimate gain a +6 enhancement bonus to their Strength and Dexterity, or a +8 enhancement bonus to either Strength or Dexterity. These bonuses supercede those of Empowered Reanimate.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/death#toc107\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
